# Engineering principles

Rules this project paid for. **Loaded every session, in full.** §-IDs are cited from source
comments and must stay stable. **Ceiling: 40 lines** — adding a principle means merging or
deleting one, not appending.

> Before adding, map the candidate onto what is already here — duplicate / complement /
> conflict. Most "new" principles are a clause missing from an existing §.

